OL,3,GNEWSABoys club demolition to begin
OL,4,Aahead of #2m rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe demolition of a youth and boxing
OL,7,Fclub base - described as a "community
OL,8,Fbeacon" - will get under way on Tuesday
OL,9,Fahead of a #2m renovation.
OL,11,FThe Lifstan Boys Club building in
OL,12,FSouthend-on-Sea, Essex, has stood since
OL,13,Fthe 1960s but has fallen into
OL,14,Fdisrepair.
OL,16,FA #1.5m government grant for a
OL,17,Freplacement was withdrawn but later
OL,18,Freinstated, and has now increased to
OL,19,F#2m.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
