OL,3,GNEWSABoys club demolition to begin
OL,4,Aahead of #2m rebuild
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe replacement building - which will
OL,7,Fprovide boxing facilities, dance
OL,8,Fclasses and CV workshops - is expected
OL,9,Fto be open by September 2027.
